ja\">神社</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんじゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">神社；神道神社</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"181873\"><ruby>京都<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>神社<rp>(</rp><rt>じんじゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">京都有许多神社。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/875092\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">水泳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいえい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">游泳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158056\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>午後<rp>(</rp><rt>ごご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>水泳<rp>(</rp><rt>すいえい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我下午在暑假的时候游泳</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">水道</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">自来水</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">水</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">数学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すうがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164719\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはこの<ruby>数学<rp>(</rp><rt>すうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はわからない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个数学问题比我想的要多</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">過ぎる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すぎる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经过；通过；超越；流逝；消逝；期满；结束；完了；超过；超越；超出；不过是；仅仅；过度；太；过于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223657\">このスープは、しょっぱ<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎて<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めないよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这汤太咸了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变得不拥挤；稀疏；变空；饥饿；肚子饿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200305\">どの<ruby>車両<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がすいていますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪辆车比较拥挤?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スクリーン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">屏幕；幕布</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204737\">それらの<ruby>単語<rp>(</rp><rt>たんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のコンピューター・スクリーンに<ruby>現<rp>(</rp><rt>あらわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れたのだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这句话会出现在他的电脑屏幕上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">凄い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すごい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">可怕的；令人惊恐的；惊人的；了不起的；非常棒的；极好的；数量庞大的；极其广大的；极其；非常；十分</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143317\"><ruby>凄<rp>(</rp><rt>すご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かりが<ruby>野球場<rp>(</rp><rt>やきゅうじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあたっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">棒球场上散发着一束光</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">進む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すすむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">前进；向前移动；领先；走在前面；取得进展；进步；加深；加剧；（时钟）走快；超前；自愿；主动做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189159\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>すす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいますか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你和英语课相处得怎么样?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すっかり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完全；彻底；全部；整个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160525\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすっかり<ruby>息<rp>(</rp><rt>いき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我完全喘不过气来了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笔直地；迅速地；直接地；突然地；悄悄地；轻柔地；温和地；感到神清气爽；感到畅快满足</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76795\">カタツムリがすっと<ruby>角<rp>(</rp><rt>つの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蜗牛射出它的角。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">捨てる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すてる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抛弃；丢弃；扔掉；遗弃；抛弃；舍弃；放弃；辞去；弃子（棋子）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204154\">そんな<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>捨<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ててしまいなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把计划放在垃圾堆上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ステレオ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">立体声；立体声音响；立体声设备；立体声的；立体音响的；立体影像的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161560\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあの<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいステレオを<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在那家店里有台新音响</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ステーキ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">牛排；扒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214623\">ステーキの<ruby>焼<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうなさいますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你喜欢你的牛排吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">砂；沙粒；细砾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174298\"><ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>うし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろ<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>あし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>砂<rp>(</rp><rt>すな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかけるようなことをした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他高举他的脚跟反对我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すばらしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=